B. Route Touch & Memory Pressure in HostSessionEngine.kt
In HostSessionEngine.kt:
 * Track @Volatile private var webLayerActive = !shizukuController.isAuthorized() and pass onLaunchAppFromTaskbar = { pkg -> launchAppExclusive(pkg) } + onWorkspaceLayerChanged = { active -> webLayerActive = active; encoder?.requestSyncFrameBurst() } when constructing VirtualDisplayPresentation.
 * Call pres.updateLaunchableApps(shizukuController.listLaunchableApps(emptySet(), emptySet())) right after pres.show() so the tablet taskbar's ⊞ Apps button is immediately populated.
 * In readControlLoop (BinaryTouch) and sendTrackpadDelta, route to presentation?.injectInProcessTouch(...) whenever webLayerActive || !shizukuController.isAuthorized(), and otherwise call shizukuController.injectTouchOnDisplay(...).
 * In startAdvisorLoop(), if sample.freeRamPercent < 25 and !webLayerActive, call presentation?.trimWebMemoryToColdBundle(); and in disconnectInternal(), call oldPres?.releaseWebResources() before oldPres?.dismiss().
4. Eliminate Android 7 DT_TEXTREL Dialog on Galaxy Tab 2 (app/build.gradle.kts)
Add a productFlavors block in app/build.gradle.kts so you can install displayLegacy (targetSdk = 22) on your modded Galaxy Tab 2 while keeping hostModern (targetSdk = 34) for your Android 10+ Host:
android {
    // ... existing defaultConfig ...
    flavorDimensions += "deviceTier"
    productFlavors {
        create("hostModern") {
            dimension = "deviceTier"
            targetSdk = 34
        }
        create("displayLegacy") {
            dimension = "deviceTier"
            // Bypasses Android 7's DT_TEXTREL dialog on PowerVR SGX544 vendor libs
            targetSdk = 22
        }
    }
}

On-Device Verification Checklist
 * Install Both Flavors: Build and install hostModernDebug on your Android 10+ Host and displayLegacyDebug on your Galaxy Tab 2. Cold-launch the tablet—the standby screen opens immediately with zero text-relocation dialog.
 * Verify Live Stream & Stateful WebView (Zero ADB): Connect from the Host over Same Wi-Fi. Within 1 second, the tablet renders the desktop workspace at 25–60 FPS with the live ticking clock, and tapping/typing on the tablet browses desktop sites in 🌐 Web Workspace.
 * Activate Full Native DeX Freeform Windows: Start Shizuku via USB ADB on the Host, tap ⊞ Apps on the tablet's bottom taskbar, and launch two native apps (e.g., Brave + Files). Both open on displayId 1 as resizable, overlapping tablet-mode windows (--windowingMode 5) while your WebView tabs stay paused in RAM for instant pull-back.
